<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-LIBERTADORES CUP RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LIBERTADORES CUP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>PORTO ALEGRE, Brazil 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gremio (Brazil)</p>
<p>beat Cruzeiro (Brazil) 2-1 (halftime 0-0) in a South American</p>
<p>Libertadores Cup quarter-final, second leg match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Gremio - Mauro Galvao (71st minute), Ze Alcino (74th)</p>
<p>Cruzeiro - Fabinho (60th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 50,000</p>
<p>Cruzeiro win 3-2 on aggregate.</p>
<p>Semifinals (first legs to be played July 23, second legs</p>
<p>July 30)</p>
<p>Colo Colo (Chile) v Cruzeiro, Sporting Cristal (Peru) v</p>
<p>Racing Club (Argentina)</p>
